      "lines": [
        "Upon summoning, Clone acquires all",
        "characteristics, including color, of any one",
        "creature in play on either side; any creature",
        "enchantments on original creature are not copied.",
        "Clone retains these characteristics even after",
        "original creature is destroyed. Clone cannot be",
        "summoned if there are no creatures in play."
