        "{5}, {T}: Creates one Giant Wasp, a 1/1 flying",
        "creature. Represent Wasps with tokens, making",
        "sure to indicate when each Wasp is tapped. Wasps",
        "can’t attack during the turn created. Treat Wasps",
        "like artifact creatures in every way, except that",
        "they are removed from the game entirely if they",
